{"id":"605050","name":"巨无霸汉堡","author":"Magic叮咚","authorId":"11490259","desc":"","cover":"images/605050/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"汉堡面包","amount":"1个"},{"name":"切片芝士","amount":"2片"},{"name":"烤牛肉排","amount":"2个"},{"name":"煎蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"2片"}],"sub":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"黄油","amount":"30g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"30g"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"20g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"15g"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1小勺"},{"name":"黑胡椒粉","amount":"1/2小勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1/2小勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉剁成肉馅。","img":"images/605050/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"其他材料准备好。","img":"images/605050/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛肉馅里加入融化的黄油，朝一个方向搅拌均匀。","img":"images/605050/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入鸡蛋和面粉，朝一个方向搅拌均匀。","img":"images/605050/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洋葱和蒜切碎。","img":"images/605050/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入洋葱碎、蒜碎、黑胡椒面、盐。","img":"images/605050/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"调制好的牛肉馅。","img":"images/605050/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取适量牛肉馅，揉圆拍扁，大约1cm厚度，放在烤盘里。","img":"images/605050/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烤箱预热好放中层，上下火200度，大约烤20分钟，中途翻面。","img":"images/605050/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"煎一个鸡蛋，出锅淋少许生抽。","img":"images/605050/step_10.jpeg"},{"step":11,"desc":"准备切片奶酪。","img":"images/605050/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"所有工作准备好后，开始巨无霸汉堡的层层搭建吧。","img":"images/605050/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"再配一碗牛奶麦片，无敌了！","img":"images/605050/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：烤箱、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}